# Surge of Salvation, ruling 2023-04-14: hexproof goes only to the permanents there as it resolves, but the damage prevention
# covers every creature Bot1 controls this turn (CR 615.1). Bot1 resolves Surge on turn 3, then casts Ornithopter. Bot2 can still
# target that Ornithopter (no hexproof: the Bolt is cast), and the Bolt's red damage is prevented, so it lives undamaged.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Surge of Salvation
Ornithopter
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Surge of Salvation.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Damage = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
